portrait-local
==============
Wraps (does not modify) LivePortrait — https://github.com/KwaiVGI/LivePortrait (MIT, see LICENSE-LivePortrait),
vendored at setup time into vendor/ (commit 9b294b3). Motion templates in templates/ are converted copies of
LivePortrait's assets/examples/driving/*.pkl (motion data only, no video).

Model weights (downloaded at setup into weights/, not redistributed here):
  - LivePortrait weights (HF KwaiVGI/LivePortrait): research release by Kuaishou.
  - InsightFace buffalo_l detection/landmark models: InsightFace states its pre-trained models are
    for NON-COMMERCIAL RESEARCH purposes only. Internal/non-commercial use only unless cleared.

Files authored here (MIT): app.py, ui.html, selftest.py, setup.sh, pack.sh, README.md

